# Animation

Animation in this project (GSAP + Lenis smooth scroll + ScrollTrigger bound to #scroll + page transitions): central plugin registration, consuming scroll via useScroll/useElementLenisPosition (not window), and cleanup discipline (kill/revert tweens/ScrollTriggers/observers/listeners on unmount).

